; https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/master/pages/common/jj-operation-revert.md

% jj-operation-revert, common

# Revert the most recent operation
jj <_op_operation_> revert

# Revert a specific operation
jj <_op_operation_> revert <operation_id>

# Revert only the repository state and local bookmarks of an operation
jj <_op_operation_> revert --what repo <operation_id>
